      "cooked": "<p>Is the damage given to each hero dealing damage or just to the first hero dealing damage?</p>\n<p>The question is, how is turn defined? Is it the global turn, counting from villain’s turn to villain’s turn? Or, is each hero’s turn considered a separate turn?</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
