      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-02T06:39:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>each hero’s turn is a turn.  the environment turn is a turn, and the villan turn is a turn.</p>\n<p>cards meant to have “round”  lasting effects are worded as such; eg Legacy’s <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Galvanize</span>  reads “Until the start of your next turn…”</p>",
