      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8491ac/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-12-06T22:12:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What happens when Backlash Field is activated as a result of Atlantean Font of Power? (Each hero has to play the top card of their hero deck, but it remains the environment deck’s turn.) Would only the first hero to do damage in this way receive the backlash, or each of them? My inclination is to give each hero the damage as normal, but perhaps it needs it needs a whole turn to “recharge”.</p>\n<p>I really hate Backlash Field by the way <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
