      "created_at": "2012-10-10T22:10:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, if you read the timestamps, you would see my reply was back in December 2011, back when I was going off what I thought Adam said back in August 2011.&nbsp; Christopher cleared this up sometime earlier this year.&nbsp; Any time I've brought this up afterwards, I've always mentioned Christopher's updated ruling.&nbsp; The only reason this topic got brought up is because someone else created a new topic with the same name as this old topic, and the new forums can't handle it. (Both end up with the same URL, which truly only points to the first topic, making the new topic unreadable.&nbsp; The person who made the \"duplicate\" topic has since reposted his topic as \"Backlash Field Second Paragraph.\")</p>",
